      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested files, I need to create each file with the necessary code to integrate with a concrete external provider for text-to-speech tasks. The provider chosen is Microsoft Azure Cognitive Services, which offers a comprehensive set of APIs for text-to-speech, including SSML synthesis, voice selection, and audio saving. Each scored implementation file will use this provider and make it identifiable in the code. The local helper files will provide configuration and utility functions to support the main tasks. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789971230396,
